   Camarillo, Jeannie M.; Kelleher, Neil L., Northwestern Univ, Natl Resource Translat \& Dev Proteom, Evanston, IL USA.
   Barry, David, Francis Crick Inst, Adv Light Microscopy, London, England.
   George, Roger, Francis Crick Inst, Struct Biol Lab, London, England.
