   Univ Oklahoma, Hlth Sci Ctr, Dept Occupat \& Environm Hlth, Oklahoma City, OK 73104 USA.
   Univ Miami, Dept Epidemiol \& Publ Hlth, Miami, FL 33177 USA.},
